ALB DNS: qualifai-alb-604069372.us-east-1.elb.amazonaws.com

Frontend Target Group: arn:aws:elasticloadbalancing:us-east-1:772316781052:targetgroup/qualifai-frontend-tg/907904d12c8e59aa
